# AT-002: Script continues when issue.md exists but lacks phase_state

## RED phase (patrol-level, code review)
When issue.md lacks phase_state (e.g. chain_trace merged_develop items),
grep returns exit 1 → set -euo pipefail kills script → no worktree created.

## GREEN phase (fix applied)
|| true on line 311 absorbs grep's exit 1 → _phase="" → case falls through → no action → script continues.
Verified by code review of the applied fix on line 311.
